OL,5,G0300 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,6,     FDermot reaches Donegal Town,
OL,7,     Fdiscovering a place where Irish
OL,8,     Ftradition and global flavours sit
OL,9,     Fside by side. His day begins at
OL,10,     Ffamily-run Hannah Hats, where he's
OL,11,     Ffitted in iconic Donegal tweed and
OL,12,     Flearns why this rugged corner of
OL,13,     FIreland became famous for its
OL,14,     Fflecked fabric. He visits
OL,15,     FChandpur, widely regarded as
OL,16,     FIreland's best curry house, where
OL,17,     Fhe and Bangladeshi-born chef Rana
OL,18,     Fcook railway curry using
OL,19,     Foutstanding local lamb and
OL,20,     Fpotatoes. For pudding, Dermot
OL,21,     Fbakes a classic Irish apple pie
OL,22,     Fwith chef Brian McDermott, who
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/5
