OL,5,G0325 Clodagh: Cooking at Home
OL,6,     FIrish chef and author Clodagh
OL,7,     FMcKenna hosts a big gathering for
OL,8,     Ffriends and family in her garden
OL,9,     Ffeaturing a super-easy menu. Among
OL,10,     Fthe dishes she makes for the event
OL,11,     Fare a speedy garden herb dip, a
OL,12,     Fcrowd-pleasing chocolate beef
OL,13,     Fchilli and a showstopping tarte
OL,14,     FTatin using shop-bought puff
OL,15,     Fpastry
